Consolidated Evaluation Report: Matchup 001_001 (Ichigo Mirror)
Build: v5-state256-action17 | Schema Patch: charge1-reset1
Checkpoint Fingerprint: 923922145
Status: PASSED ALL TIERS (>50% WIN RATE) — Fully Benchmark Verified
1. Overall Performance Summary
Across all four opponent tiers, candidate checkpoint 923922145 demonstrates solid tactical dominance in mirror play (001 vs 001). The standalone direct neural network handles lower-tier heuristics at 66.0%, while the RIDER Live Search Policy peaks at 72.5% on mid-tiers and maintains 65.9% – 70.8% win rates against high-depth search engines (MASTER and SOUL).
| Opponent Tier | Evaluator Policy | Matches Run | Record (W / L / D) | Win Rate | Mean Q | Decision Speed | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| EASY / NOVICE | Direct Network | 100 | 66 / 34 / 0 | 66.0% | 0.8896 | 303.1 matches/min | PASS |
